config FS_YAFFS
    bool "Enable YAFFS2 file system (CLOSED prebuilt core)"
    default n
    depends on FS_VFS
    help
      Answer Y to compile the YAFFS2 OH-VFS adapter and the libc symbol
      floor (printf/dprintf/qsort/ArchExcActive) required by the CLOSED
      prebuilt libyaffs2.a. Only boards that actually link the fbb
      archive (hi3322 with board_nand_backend == "yaffs") should enable
      this: the shim defines printf/dprintf and collides at link time with
      board-provided libc shims (e.g. qemu arm_mps2_an386 dprintf.c).
